' Question: what happens to a running bot when the app restarts?
' Explained by: ../06-runtime.md. Drawn by hand, high level.
@startuml 06-restart
participant "BotsModule.boot" as M
participant BotRestoreService as RS
participant IBotStore as ST
participant BotBootRecovery as BR
participant "GridExecutor\n(bot's worker)" as G
participant trading as T

M -> RS : restore_all()
RS -> RS : RUNNING, PAUSED --app_restart--> RECOVERING;\nSTARTING --app_restart--> HALTED
RS -> ST : save each changed bot
note over RS : nothing is placed; the order session\nis closed, so nothing listens to the exchange
M -> BR : run()
BR -> G : recover_after_restart() (queued)
G -> T : read what the exchange holds
G -> G : a RecoveryReport on the bot; read only, nothing placed
@enduml
